{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23440","headline":"张十八员外以新诗二十五首见寄郡楼月下吟翫通夕因题卷後封寄微之 · 白居易","name":"张十八员外以新诗二十五首见寄郡楼月下吟翫通夕因题卷後封寄微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦城南省清秋夜，江郡东楼明月时。\n去我三千六百里，得君二十五篇诗。\n阳春曲调高难和，淡水交情老始知。\n坐到天明吟未足，重封转寄与微之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}